# Settings the Editor saves with LF line endings even when nothing changed: the Project Auditor module's (on a script
# reload or when the Editor quits), the build settings' and the quality settings' (when the Editor quits). Checked out
# as LF too, so a save that changes nothing doesn't show as a change.
/ProjectSettings/ProjectAuditorSettings.asset text eol=lf
/ProjectSettings/EditorBuildSettings.asset text eol=lf
/ProjectSettings/QualitySettings.asset text eol=lf
